resources.description:
NEEDS: filename in the path, URL-encoded. Downloaded names contain spaces and non-ASCII characters, so 'me irl.mp4' becomes 'me%20irl.mp4'.

RETURNS 200: { "success": true, "message": "File deleted successfully" }

SECURITY: the path guard does not work. path.join collapses ../ before the startsWith check, so a crafted filename deletes files outside downloads/. Do not expose this endpoint publicly.
